# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for the Holton-Mass interference project
#
# Policy (pre-publication, PUBLIC repo):
#   - Publish only the HM model code skeleton (models/, plot/, HM scripts, fortran source).
#   - Do NOT publish anything that reveals unpublished results or the manuscript:
#       * manuscript/     (paper drafts and figures)
#       * output/         (all data, figures, and analysis reports)
#       * ERA5 observational analysis code + data
#   - Do NOT publish large binary / regenerable data products.
#
# After the paper is accepted, relax these rules (e.g. release output data,
# ERA5 scripts, and manuscript figures as appropriate).
# =============================================================================




# --- Manuscript (drafts + figures) ---
manuscript/
.kiro/

# --- All generated output: data, figures, reports (regenerable / unpublished) ---
output/

# --- Notebooks (exploratory; large; may contain unpublished results) ---
notebooks/

# --- ERA5 observational analysis code (unpublished until paper accepted) ---
scripts/era5/

# --- Large / binary data products (never belong in git) ---
*.npz
*.nc
*.grib
*.grb
*.hdf
*.h5

# --- Python caches / build artifacts ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
